T* (Contact ? One interaction: a call, chat, task, or email. A transfer usually creates another) Tj
T* (contact linked by PreviousContactId and NextContactId.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instance ? The Connect container in one Region. It holds users, flows, queues, and numbers.) Tj
T* (A new account starts at two instances per Region.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Contact flow ? The visual program a contact runs. The JSON form is the flow language.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Flow module ? A published, reusable piece of a flow. Invoke module runs it. Return ends it.) Tj
T* (Default quota is 200 modules.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Contact attribute ? A string key and value stored on the contact. Lambda, Lex, and Set) Tj
T* (contact attributes write them. Screen pop reads them.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Customer queue flow ? The interruptible flow that runs while the customer waits, before an) Tj
T* (agent joins.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Whisper flow ? Audio played to one party immediately before the customer and agent are) Tj
T* (joined.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Working queue ? The queue selected by Set working queue. Transfer to queue uses it.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Routing profile ? The list of queues an agent can receive, with channel concurrency,) Tj
T* (priority, and delay.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Priority ? A number on a queue inside a routing profile. A lower number is served first.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Delay ? Seconds a contact must wait before an agent with that profile can receive it.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Routing criteria ? Ordered steps that tighten or relax who can take the contact. The) Tj
T* (successor idea to precision-queue steps.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Proficiency ? A level on a predefined attribute for an agent. Default quota is 10) Tj
T* (proficiencies per agent.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Queue ? Where a contact waits. Standard queues hold customers. Agent queues hold transfers) Tj
T* (to a specific user, 10 contacts each by default.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Hours of operation ? The weekly schedule and time zone attached to a queue. Check hours of) Tj
T* (operation reads it. Overrides cover holidays.) Tj
T* () Tj
